{"id": "69521", "title": "本命年的骚乱", "author": "醉卧纱帐", "category": "都市言情", "count": 139, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69521.htm", "intro": "年初陪阿琼逛街，见街边一道士模样的老头摆一小摊，摊前一副对联，上书“算天算地算人生”，下写“度山度水度浮尘”，横批“每命五元”。我从不信那些算命的，总觉得命已天成，算了又能怎样？可见那道士相貌不凡，一双眼睛似睁似眯，配以那幅对联，倒觉得另有一份风采，不禁大为好奇，想看其有何高明之处，便请他算上一卦。\r\n老头微睁双眼，让我报上生辰八字，待我报完，阿琼非要和我一起算，也把生辰八字报上。老头并不多说，又眯起眼睛掐着手指，口中不知念了些啥玩意，弄了一阵后睁开眼睛，说出一番不清不楚的话来：“年逢本命，恐有磨难，需时时保持冷静，若能平安度过，他日鸿运无边。遇事别冲动，三思而后行，切记切记。”", "base": "files/article/html/69/69521", "chapters": [{"title": "全文阅读", "volume": true}, {"title": "楔", "file": "10642254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一", "file": "10642255.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "10642256.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "10642257.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "10642258.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "10642259.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "10642260.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "10642261.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "10642262.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "10642263.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "10642264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "10642265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二", "file": "10642266.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "10642267.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四", "file": "10642268.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五", "file": "10642269.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六", "file": "10642270.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七", "file": "10642271.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十八", "file": "10642272.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十九", "file": "10642273.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十", "file": "10642274.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十一", "file": "10645405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十二", "file": "10645406.html", "available": false}, {"title":